阅读下面的伪代码，说明输出结果体现了分层多智能体系统的什么行为：

class Agent:
    def __init__(self, name, subordinates=None):
        self.name = name
        self.subordinates = subordinates or []

    def handle(self, task):
        if not self.subordinates:
            return f"{self.name} executed {task}"
        parts = task.split("+")
        return [s.handle(p) for s, p in zip(self.subordinates, parts)]

top = Agent("top", [Agent("a"), Agent("b")])
print(top.handle("x+y"))

阅读下面的伪代码，指出其中可能存在的分层多智能体设计缺陷：

class Agent:
    def __init__(self, name, parent=None):
        self.name = name
        self.parent = parent

    def handle(self, task):
        if task == "hard":
            return self.parent.handle(task)
        if not self.parent:
            return "unhandled"
        return self.parent.handle(task)
